The API may calculate a bounded post-commit status hint, but durable assessment owns materialized results. Ordinary eligible votes need no Admin approval; held observations and reviewable cases follow their own states. New correction media/claims enter WF1, not direct report uploads. System Diagrams §6.2 shows the actor journey; §4.3–§4.5 distinguish vote, dispute and report states.
