"publicMessage": "Thông tin ram dốc cần được xác nhận lại tại hiện trường."
}
Do not expose FeatureConfidence as a new value after age decay. Missing community projection may be computed from VerifiedAt on read and reconciled asynchronously, without fabricating independent votes. Unknown feature: 404 FEATURE_NOT_PUBLISHED with WF-01 contribution CTA.
B.5.2 POST /api/v1/locations/{locationId}/features/{featureType}/votes
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <User JWT access token> under WF-01 B.0.13; Idempotency-Key required. Request:
{
"scopeId": "<scope-uuid>",
  "observedFeatureVersion": 2,
"voteType": "Changed",
